@SignedDifferenceSets.EvenCert.not_hasSDS : ∀ {w : SignedDifferenceSets.Row} {e : SignedDifferenceSets.EvenCert},
  SignedDifferenceSets.EvenCert.Ok w e →
    SignedDifferenceSets.EvenCert.search w e = true →
